The MIT License above applies to all original Pryzma components, including:
- Multi-draw regional chunk meshing & zero-stall memory compaction (VboRegion, PrRenderRegionManager)
- Real-time lock-free dynamic lights engine (PrDynamicLights)
- Biome-lattice Gaussian memoization and rain cache (PrBiomeLattice, PrBiomeCache)
- Section-occlusion entity culling (PrEntityCulling)
- Decorator LOD distance truncation (PrDetailClassifier)
- Custom lighting, colormaps & zero-allocation GUI Lightmap isolation (PryzmaLightmap, PrGuiLightmap)
- Connected Textures (CTM), Custom Item Textures (CIT), Custom Entity Models (CEM)
- Multi-layer rotatable celestial dome and skybox rendering (PrSkyRenderer)
- Hardware F3 debug overlay GPU RenderCache, zoom engine, and clean menu ergonomics

