3. BUNDLED THIRD-PARTY LIBRARIES
================================================================================

Pryzma bundles the following third-party components under their respective licenses:

- glsl-transformer (io.github.douira):
  Bundled unmodified as a nested Jar-in-Jar dependency under `META-INF/jarjar/`.
  Licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License version 3.0 (AGPL-3.0).
  Copyright (c) douira and contributors.

- jcpp (org.anarres):
  Bundled unmodified as a nested Jar-in-Jar dependency under `META-INF/jarjar/`.
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  Copyright (c) anarres and contributors.

- ithaka-digraph (`net.pryzma.shader.vendored.digraph`):
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  Copyright (c) 2012 Odysseus Software GmbH.

